---

polarln includes types ported from Polar (https://github.com/jamaljsr/polar).
These types are in src/typescript and src/polar_methods.
src/polar_docker includes the Polar v4.0.0 network, node, compose file,
startup, and tool logic for bitcoind and LND nodes: the network, node,
bitcoin, and lightning tools, the bitcoind and LND services, and the LND
channel mappers. It also includes the Polar v4.0.0 networks file format
and the Polar chart builders (src/utils/chart.ts).
src/polar_app includes the Polar data folder rule (src/utils/config.ts),
the bridge port rule (electron/constants.ts), and the health answer of the
bridge (electron/mcpBridge.ts).
scripts/headless_spike.ts includes the Polar v4.0.0 compose templates
and node commands.
src/polar_cli/bundled_tools.ts includes the names, descriptions, and input
schemas of the Polar v4.0.0 MCP tools (src/store/models/mcp). The build
copies them to dist/polar_cli.
